    {
      "displayText": "It doesn’t seem to be connected to Rogue Mega\nEvolution, but still...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhatever’s at the center of all that power makes\nmy hair stand on end!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
