    },
    {
      "displayText": "The form of Hoopa you battled in hyperspace is\ncalled Hoopa Unbound. That’s how it looked<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbefore its powers were sealed away.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
